      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: ₹0.47 loss per share (improved from ₹1.82 loss in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹3.18b (up 19% from 3Q 2025). Net loss: ₹101.6m (loss narrowed 72% from 3Q 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, the company's share price growth rate has exceeded its earnings growth rate by 111 percentage points per year, which is a significant difference in performance.",
